  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Embercore_Angel.jpg\" title=\"Embercore Angel\"><img alt=\"Embercore Angel\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"549\" src=\"/images/Embercore_Angel.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Embercore_Angel.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Embercore Angel</div></div></div>\n<p>Angels tend to stay back and cast magic bolts at their opponent. Divine Angels also have the ability to cast Attack Curse, lowering your attack rating for a short period of time; while Dark Angels can cast Damage Curse to lower your damage output.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Demi-Human\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Mage\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Embercore Angel\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>The <a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Path\" title=\"Embercore Path\">Embercore Path</a>, level 6 - 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Angel\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td> The <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Embrace</a> level 5 - 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dark Angel\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td>  The <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Embrace</a> level 5 - 7, <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fetid Angel\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[1/2] Slacker\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> offs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[GoS] Angel\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[GG] Harpy\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> GoS offs\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
